     [38;5;246mOwns current-user state: get, set-on-login, clear-on-logout, persisted. One authoritative answer to "who's logged [39m
     [38;5;246min?" for all future forms.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Stored identifier only
     [38;5;246mJust a persisted userId string other code reads to tag submissions and logs. Smaller surface now; costly to grow [39m
     [38;5;246minto a session later.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Session + change notification
     [38;5;246mThe session module plus a subscribe/event hook so forms react when the user logs in or out. Useful if the UI must [39m
